---

<section
  class="van-hero bg-slate-900 px-4 pb-2 pt-8 text-white sm:px-6 sm:pt-10"
  aria-labelledby="van-hero-heading"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <p class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-brand-redondark sm:text-xs">
      Veteran-Owned • 150+ Google Reviews • Katy &amp; West Houston
    </p>
    <h1 id="van-hero-heading" class="text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
      Need it fixed, installed, or improved?
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-white/85 sm:text-lg">
      Book a standard service online or send photos for a clear estimate.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
